><span class="rounded-full bg-accent"></span><span class="rounded-full bg-accent"></span><span class="rounded-full bg-ink-muted/25"></span><span class="rounded-full bg-ink-muted/25"></span><span class="rounded-full bg-ink-muted/25"></span></span><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><h2 id="gruppe-lernwerkstatt" class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Lernwerkstatt</h2><p class="mt-1 text-ink-muted ">Selbst üben mit Spielstand · für Kinder und Jugendliche · frei, ohne Anmeldung</p><ul class="mt-3 grid gap-x-8 gap-y-1 md:grid-cols-2"><li><a class="group block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 -mx-3 hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent" href="/programme/tastenflow"><span class="flex gap-4"><span class="min-w-0"><span class="font-semibold text-ink underline decoration-hairline underline-offset-4 group-hover:decoration-accent">Tastenflow</span><span class="text-sm text-ink-muted"> - Zehn-Finger-Schreiben</span></span></span></a></li><li><a class="group block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 -mx-3 hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent" href="/programme/punktgenau"><span class="flex gap-4"><span class="min-w-0"><span class="font-semibold text-ink underline decoration-hairline underline-offset-4 group-hover:decoration-accent">Punktgenau</span><span class="text-sm text-ink-muted"> - Brailleschrift lernen</span></span></span></a></li><li><a class="group block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 -mx-3 hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent" href="/programme/klangpunkte"><span class="flex gap-4"><span class="min-w-0"><span class="font-semibold text-ink underline decoration-hairline underline-offset-4 group-hover:decoration-accent">Klangpunkte</span><span class="text-sm text-ink-muted"> - Braille-Noten lesen</span></span></span></a></li><li><a class=