en focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent" href="/programme/zeichen-fuer-zeichen"><span class="flex gap-4"><span class="min-w-0"><span class="font-semibold text-ink underline decoration-hairline underline-offset-4 group-hover:decoration-accent">Zeichen für Zeichen</span><span class="text-sm text-ink-muted"> - so liest die Braillezeile</span></span></span></a></li><li><a class="group block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 -mx-3 hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent" href="/programme/tabellen-auf-der-braillezeile"><span class="flex gap-4"><span class="min-w-0"><span class="font-semibold text-ink underline decoration-hairline underline-offset-4 group-hover:decoration-accent">Tabellen</span><span class="text-sm text-ink-muted"> - Zelle für Zelle</span></span></span></a></li><li><a class="group block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 -mx-3 hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent" href="/programme/bild-beschreiben"><span class="flex gap-4"><span class="min-w-0"><span class="font-semibold text-ink underline decoration-hairline underline-offset-4 group-hover:decoration-accent">Bild beschreiben</span><span class="text-sm text-ink-muted"> - reicht die Beschreibung?</span></span></span></a></li></ul><p class="mt-3 text-sm"><a class="font-medium text-accent underline underline-offset-2" href="/erleben">Alle Simulationen <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p></div></section></div><p class="mt-8 text-center text-sm"><a class="text-accent underline underline-offset-2" href="/">← Zur Startseite</a></p><footer aria-label="Rechtliches" class="mt-4 text-center text-xs text-ink-muted"><a class="underline underline-offset-2" href="/datenschutz">Datenschutz</a> · <a class="underline underline-offset-2" href="/impressum">Impressum</a> · <a class="underline underline